 as $25.1 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $25.1 million.","cites":["META.pay.peoTotal.2025","META.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $22.1 million in total and $38.5 million actually paid.","cites":["META.pay.neoTotal.2025","META.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $243.32 at the end of FY2025, and $445.33 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["META.pay.tsr.2025","META.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.1 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $772 million a year earlier.","cites":["META.deferred.2025","META.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 78,865 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $2.5 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["META.q.employees","META.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $35.9 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $45.7 billion in short-term investments, and $58.7 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $22.8 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["META.cash.2025","META.sti.2025","META.debtLong.2025"]}]},"fin":{"META":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":159,"read":159,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Bosworth Andrew","Chief Technology Officer"],["Mahoney Curtis J.","Chief Legal Officer"],["LI SUSAN J","Chief Financial Officer"],["Olivan Javier","Chief Operating Officer"],["Andreessen Marc L","Director"],["Alford Peggy","Director"],["Zuckerberg Mark","COB and CEO, director"]